00:00:00,333 --> 00:00:02,423
This is about $2000.

2
00:00:03,502 --> 00:00:07,772
(Sheldon:)Um, I think she likes monkeys
and the color gray.

3
00:00:14,113 --> 00:00:16,643
Contribute to my work. Heh.

4
00:00:19,118 --> 00:00:22,318
Ah, kids say the darndest things.

5
00:00:24,824 --> 00:00:26,954
- Hey, you coming to lunch?
- Yeah, one second.

6
00:00:27,159 --> 00:00:28,749
- I wanna show you something.
- What?

7
00:00:28,961 --> 00:00:33,691
(Howard:)I was trying to come up with something
really romantic to give Bernadette...

8
00:00:33,933 --> 00:00:37,963
(Amy:)...for Valentine's Day
since she's been such a pain in the ass.

9
00:00:40,172 --> 00:00:42,702
(Leonard:)You can't find a card that says that?

10
00:00:43,843 --> 00:00:47,713
Check it out. I used the atomic-force
microscope in the materials-science lab...

11
00:00:47,947 --> 00:00:53,317
(Howard:)...and wrote our initials in a heart one
one-thousandth the size of a grain of sand.

